  unitName: Mantis
  unitId: 30661
  unitNumber: 1162
  description: An insect native to Ishgria with a combative and vicious personality.
    It is omnivorous, and will devour both plants and small animals. It was once
    thought that this insect had some flight ability due to its feather-like features,
    but recent research has revealed that it has virtually no abilities of this sort.
    The features once seen as feathers have been discovered to be part of its sense
    of touch. Using them, it detects changes in the movement of the air around it
    to track other creatures.
